# Placing objects in the scenario editor: a war factory chosen in the Add Game
# Object dialog, then a soldier, a tank and a tree reached with the keys that
# change the pending object on the map (PgUp for the category, Right for the
# next object, H for the house), and ore painted by dragging. Then a placed
# object's own controls: the tank's health gauge dragged down, its facing
# dial, mission and house lists clicked, and Delete.
#
# The map takes a button that is down when it looks, so a placement holds it
# for a few frames: a click that ends in the frame it began places nothing.
# args: -EDITOR
at 201 rclick 400 150
at 241 key DOWN
at 245 key DOWN
at 249 key DOWN
at 253 key DOWN
at 263 key RETURN
# The Building category, and its third building.
at 301 click 328 92
at 341 key RIGHT
at 345 key RIGHT
at 380 shot dialog_war_factory
at 381 key RETURN
at 400 move 375 195
at 440 shot building_pending
at 441 press 375 195
at 444 release 375 195
at 460 key ESC
at 500 shot building_placed
# Insert takes up the last choice again.
at 501 key INSERT
at 505 key PGUP
at 509 key PGUP
at 513 key H
at 520 move 420 200
at 560 shot infantry_pending
at 561 press 420 200
at 564 release 420 200
at 580 key PGUP
at 584 key RIGHT
at 600 move 300 80
at 640 shot unit_pending
at 641 press 300 80
at 644 release 300 80
at 660 key PGUP
at 680 move 440 100
at 700 shot terrain_pending
at 701 press 440 100
at 704 release 440 100
at 720 key PGUP
at 724 key PGUP
at 740 move 230 100
at 760 shot overlay_pending
at 761 press 230 100
at 765 move 250 100
at 770 move 270 100
at 775 release 270 100
at 790 key ESC
at 820 shot all_placed
at 821 press 300 80
at 824 release 300 80
at 860 shot unit_selected
at 861 press 244 173
at 865 move 230 173
at 870 move 215 173
at 875 release 215 173
at 880 click 186 175
at 890 click 90 166
at 900 click 30 116
at 940 shot unit_edited
at 941 key DELETE
at 980 shot unit_deleted
at 981 press 400 210
at 984 release 400 210
at 1020 shot building_selected
at 1021 quit
